flowchart TD
    %% User and Entry Point
    User([User / Corporate Traveler]) -->|Natural Language Prompt & CSV| API[FastAPI Application]
    API -->|Initialize Blackboard State| State[(Pydantic Blackboard State)]

    %% Orchestrator & Memory Recall
    subgraph Unit_III_Memory [Unit III: Memory & Tool Interaction]
        DB[(SQLite Persistent Storage)]
        HistStore[(Report History Store)]
        PrefStore[(User Preferences Store)]
        DB --> HistStore
        DB --> PrefStore
    end

    API --> Orchestrator[Orchestrator Agent]
    Orchestrator <-->|Memory Recall: Check Prior Reports| HistStore
    Orchestrator <-->|Read User Preferences| PrefStore
    Orchestrator -->|Write Execution Plan| State

    %% Specialist Processing Agents
    subgraph Specialists [Specialist Pipeline Agents]
        DataRet[Data Retrieval Agent]
        ValAgent[Filter & Validation Agent]
        CatAgent[Categorization Agent]
        CalcAgent[Calculation Agent]
    end

    Orchestrator --> DataRet
    DataRet -->|Raw Expenses| State
    DataRet --> ValAgent
    ValAgent -->|Filtered Expenses & Flags| State
    ValAgent --> CatAgent
    CatAgent -->|Categorized Expenses| State
    CatAgent --> CalcAgent
    CalcAgent -->|Subtotals & Confirmed Grand Total| State

    %% Unit IV Multi-Agent Review and Recovery Loop
    subgraph Unit_IV_Collaboration [Unit IV: Multi-Agent Collaboration & Review]
        RevAgent[Expense Review Agent]
        CorrAgent[Correction Agent]
        MsgBus[Structured AgentMessage Bus]
    end

    CalcAgent --> RevAgent
    RevAgent -->|Audit Totals, Duplicates, Fields| State

    %% Conditional Review Routing
    RevAgent -->|Status: Needs Correction & Retries < 3| MsgBus
    MsgBus -->|Structured Correction Request| CorrAgent
    CorrAgent -->|Recalculate & Fix Blackboard| State
    CorrAgent -->|Correction Result Message| MsgBus
    CorrAgent -->|Re-Review Pass| RevAgent

    %% Escalation and Report Generation
    RevAgent -->|Status: Passed OR Retries >= 3| RepAgent[Report Generation Agent]
    RepAgent -->|Generate ReportLab PDF| PDFArtifact[/PDF Report Artifact/]
    RepAgent --> MemPersist[Memory Persistence Agent]

    %% Persistence to Long-Term Memory
    MemPersist -->|Save Completed Summary & Findings| HistStore

    %% Gated Email Dispatch and Human Approval
    MemPersist --> CheckGate{Review Passed & Approved?}
    CheckGate -->|Yes: Auto-Approved| EmailAgent[Email Dispatch Agent]
    CheckGate -->|No: Needs Human Review| HumanGate[Human Approval Gate]
    
    HumanGate -->|Approved via UI / API| EmailAgent
    HumanGate -->|Rejected| EndHalt([Halt: Dispatch Cancelled])
    EmailAgent -->|Dispatch SMTP / Dev Simulation| Done([Report Delivered to Finance])

    %% State Synchronization
    State -.->|Real-Time Status Polling| Frontend[React Web Dashboard]
    HistStore -.->|Query Saved Reports| Frontend
